sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Developer as Developer (cdk deploy)
    participant CFN as AWS CloudFormation
    participant Provider as Custom Resource Provider
    participant Lambda as BatchIoTFunction (Node.js 20.x)
    participant IoT as AWS IoT Core
    participant S3 as S3 Bucket (RoboticBucket)

    Developer->>CFN: Trigger Stack Deployment (Pass thingNames array)
    CFN->>Provider: Invoke Custom Resource Event (Create/Update)
    Provider->>Lambda: Trigger handler()
    
    loop Loop over each thingName
        Lambda->>IoT: 1. Create Thing (CreateThing)
        Lambda->>IoT: 2. Generate Credentials (CreateKeysAndCertificate)
        Lambda->>IoT: 3. Bind IoT Policy (CreatePolicy & AttachThingPrincipal)
        Lambda->>S3: 4. Export private key & certificate files
    end

    Lambda-->>Provider: Report success with file storage URLs
    Provider-->>CFN: Report SUCCESS state
    CFN-->>Developer: Stack Deployed Successfully
